273
00:13:18,429 --> 00:13:20,131
Setiap hari.

274
00:13:20,164 --> 00:13:22,900
Tuan - tuan, perkenalkan Alexander.

275
00:13:22,933 --> 00:13:24,702
Aku sendiri yang memilihnya...

276
00:13:24,735 --> 00:13:27,038
