277
00:13:27,071 --> 00:13:29,407
Tn. Alexander pemenang
Kejuaraan Catur Nasional Inggris.

278
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,875
Dua kali.

279
00:13:30,908 --> 00:13:32,209
Kau bukan satu - satunya...

280
00:13:32,242 --> 00:13:33,744
