Anak - anak, kami
mau makan siang.

339
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:15,199
Alan ?

340
00:17:15,232 --> 00:17:16,667
Ya ?

341
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:18,503
Kubilang kami akan makan siang.

342
00:17:21,138 --> 00:17:22,606
Alan ?

343
00:17:22,639 --> 00:17:23,674
Ya ?

344
