Kau dengar ?
/ Ya.

345
00:17:25,175 --> 00:17:28,479
Kubilang kami mau
makan siang...

346
00:17:28,512 --> 00:17:30,848
Ini sudah berulang - ulang.

347
00:17:30,881 --> 00:17:32,283
Apa ?
/ Aku bertanya...

348
00:17:32,316 --> 00:17:33,951
