349
00:17:33,984 --> 00:17:35,386
Um, kau tak bertanya.

350
00:17:35,419 --> 00:17:37,855
Kau bilang kau akan
makan siang.

351
00:17:37,888 --> 00:17:39,957
Apa aku tak sengaja
menyinggungmu ?

352
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:41,225
Kenapa kau pikir begitu ?

353
00:17:41,258 --> 00:17:43,894
Kau mau makan siang
bersama kami ?

354
